              "1.Warm- up: (3’)\nGame: Pass the ball\n*Aims: to create a friendly and active atmosphere in the class to beginning the lesson.\n*Procedure:\n- Stand up and pass the ball with music.\n- When music stops, those who keep the ball must look at a picture on the board and say a sentence. I have……..\n- Say “Open your book page 54” and look at “Unit 18, Lesson 2 (1,2,3)”.\n2. Presentation(16’)\nActivity 1.  Vocabulary.\n*Aims: Ss will be able to know the vocabulary in the new lesson.\n*Procedure:\n-T elicits the new words\n+ skirt    : váy          (realia)\n+ T-shirt: áo thun   (realia)\n+ dong   : đồng  (đơn vị tiền tệ Việt Nam)\n(realia)\n+ thousand : nghìn                 (translation)\n- T models (3 times).\n- T writes the words on the board.\n- Checking: What and where\nActivity 2.   Look, listen and repeat:\n*Aims: Ss will be able to understand and correctly repeat the sentences in two communicative contexts focusing on asking and answering questions about prices.\n*Procedure:\n- Have Ss look at Pictures a and b and elicit the names of the speakers in the pictures.\n<img src=\"assets/khbd_images/lop4/tieng_anh/tuan_30/image8.png\" alt=\"image8.png\" style=\"max-width: 95%; height: auto;\" />\n- Play the audio twice (sentence by sentence). Correct their pronunciation where necessary.\n- Have Ss to practice the diaguage\n- T invites a few pairs to the front of the class to practice.\n- T checks pronunciation for ss.\nActivity 3. Listen, point and say.\n*Aims: Ss will be able to correctly say the words and phrases and use How much is the…….? – It’s ………. to ask and answer questions about prices.\n*Procedure:\n* Model sentences:\n- T asks Ss look at picture b and helps Ss know the structure from the dialogue.\n- T introduces new structure for Ss.\n- T explains, models and gives meaning.\n- Have Ss repeat the model sentences.\n3.Practice: (7’)\n*Drill pictures\n-  Have Ss point at Picture a, listen to the recording and repeat the word and phrase pen / twenty thousand dong.\n<img src=\"assets/khbd_images/lop4/tieng_anh/tuan_30/image9.png\" alt=\"image9.png\" style=\"max-width: 95%; height: auto;\" />\n- Run through all the pictures.\n- Run through model sentences.\n+Run through the question sentences\n+Run through the answer sentences\n- Have Ss to practise:\n+ T asks, Ss answer picture a\n+ Ss ask, T answers picture b\n+ Group A ask, group B answer picture c\n+ Group B ask, group A answer picture d\n- Ask Ss to work in pairs.\n- T controls and corrects.\n- Invite a few pairs to come to the front of the classroom, point at the pictures and say in front of the class.\n- T gives feedbacks.\n4.Production: (7’)\nActivity 4.     Let’s talk.\n*Aims: Ss will be able to enhance the correct use of How much is the …..? – It’s ……... to ask and answer questions about prices in a freer context.\n*Procedure:\n-   Elicit the words or phrases used to describe prices.\n<img src=\"assets/khbd_images/lop4/tieng_anh/tuan_30/image10.png\" alt=\"image10.png\" style=\"max-width: 95%; height: auto;\" />\n-  Elicit the missing words in the first bubble.\n+ Ask Ss to look at the second bubble and identify what the answer should be.\n+ Give an example conversation, ex: How much is the T-shirt? – It’s fifty thousand dong.\n+ Get Ss to repeat the question and the answer several times\n-  Have pairs practise asking and answering the questions about the prices of the items in the picture.\n- Invite a few pairs to practise asking and answering questions in front of the class.\n*Consolidation\n*Aims: Ss will be able consolidate and wrap up the content of the lesson.\n*Procedure:\n- T asks ss to answer the following questions:\n+ What have you learnt from the lesson today?\n- T praises some Ss who are hardworking / active/ good…. as well as encourage others to try more.\n5. Homework. (2’)\n- Learn the vocabulary and model sentences by heart\n- Prepare the new lesson: Unit 18, Lesson 2 (4,5,6).\nDigital & AI mini-task: “Shop price – Check it!”\n- T displays shop/price pictures and one AI-style price/location sentence with a mismatch.\n- T asks pupils to compare and correct it.\n- Digital/AI evidence: pupil verifies one price/location using the visual evidence.",
              "- Ss listen \n\n- Ss play the game\n\n\n- Ss open their books\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n-Ss listen and answer\n\n\n- - Ss listen and repeat \n+ Choral repetition (3 times). \n+ Individual repetition (3 ss)\n\n- Ss take note\n- Ss look, remember and say\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n-Look at the pictures and get to know the characters in the pictures.\n+ In picture a: \nLinh’s mother: How much is the T-shirt, Linh?\nLinh: It’s sixty thousand dong.\n– In picture b: \nLinh: How much is the skirt, Mum?\nLinh’s mother: It’s seventy thousand dong.\n\n\n-Ss listen and repeat in chorus (twice)\n\n-Ss work in pairs to practice\n-Ss practice the diaguage\n\n-Ss listen\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n-Ss look at the picture and answer.\n  \n-Ss listen\n-Ss listen and repeat\n-Ss repeat \n\n\n\n\n\n-Ss listen and answer\n+Picture a:  a pen with its price tag of twenty thousand dong\n+Picture b. a skirt with its price tag of eighty thousand dong\n+Picture c. a T-shirt with its price tag of fifty thousand dong\n+Picture d. a school bag with its price tag of ninety thousand dong\n\n\n\n- Ss look, listen and repeat\n- Ss look, listen and repeat\n\n\n- Ss practice in chorus\n\n\n\n-Ss work in pairs to practice\n-Ss listen\n\n-Ss go to the board and point and say\n\n-Ss listen\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n-Ss look at the picture and answer\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n-Ss look at the bubble and answer\n\n-Ss answer\n\n\n-Ss repeat the question and answer\n\n-Ss work in pairs to ask and answer\n\n\n-Ss practise in pair in front of the class.\n\n\n\n\n\n\n-Ss answer the question\n\n\n\n- Ss listen\n\n-Ss listen and clap their hands\n\n\n-Ss listen and take note\nDigital/AI pupil actions:\n- Ss compare the picture/price tag and sentence.\n- Ss correct one price/location detail."
